# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Spirits Calling — .gitignore
# repo 根 = Spirits-Calling/，UE 專案巢狀在 Spirits_Calling/ 底下，
# 所以 build 產物路徑要帶 Spirits_Calling/ 前綴（否則 pattern 錨不到）。
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Visual Studio / IDE
.vs/
Spirits_Calling/.vs/
Spirits_Calling/.vsconfig
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# Compiled binaries / objects / libs / executables
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj
*.gch
*.pch
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.mod
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib
*.exe
*.out
*.app
*.ipa

# Engine-generated project files
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
*.sln

# ── UE build artifacts（此專案巢狀，必須帶前綴；這是 repo 爆掉的主因）──
# Binaries 875MB / Intermediate 7.4GB / Saved 52MB / DDC —— 一律不入 git
Spirits_Calling/Binaries/
Spirits_Calling/Intermediate/
Spirits_Calling/Saved/
Spirits_Calling/DerivedDataCache/
Spirits_Calling/Build/
# 保底：任何層級的這些資料夾都擋（防未來搬動路徑）
**/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Saved/

# Map built data（可由編輯器重建，體積大）
*_BuiltData.uasset

# ── Fab / Marketplace 第三方大包（本機保留，不推 GitHub）──
# BigNiagaraBundle 789MB + sA_PickupSet_1(Basic Pickups) 45MB。
# 使用者 Epic 帳號擁有，可從 Fab 重新加入；清單見 Docs/FAB_ASSETS.md。
Spirits_Calling/Content/BigNiagaraBundle/
Spirits_Calling/Content/sA_PickupSet_1/

# 本機 build/驗證暫存 log（agent headless 產出）
_*.log
_p16_*.txt
_matparam_*.txt
